    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bell &amp; Hoof: The Silent Journey</strong> is a tiny walking simulator where you play as a gentle cow wandering a sunlit field. There\u2019s no combat, no puzzles \u2014 just a peaceful path to walk, a few bells to collect, and a chapel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 Explore a hand-crafted golden landscape<br>\ud83d\udd14 Find collectible bells hidden around the field<br>\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Walk, moo, or do absolutely nothing at all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is short, simple, and made with love. It\u2019s under 10 minutes long \u2014 more of a vibe than a challenge. If you enjoy quiet moments, warm colors, and weirdly meditative cow energy, you might just like this.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bell &amp; Hoof: The Silent Journey</strong> is a tiny walking simulator where you play as a gentle cow wandering a sunlit field. There\u2019s no combat, no puzzles \u2014 just a peaceful path to walk, a few bells to collect, and a chapel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 Explore a hand-crafted golden landscape<br>\ud83d\udd14 Find collectible bells hidden around the field<br>\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Walk, moo, or do absolutely nothing at all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is short, simple, and made with love. It\u2019s under 10 minutes long \u2014 more of a vibe than a challenge. If you enjoy quiet moments, warm colors, and weirdly meditative cow energy, you might just like this.</p>",
    "short_description": "A short walking simulator about a quiet cow, a forgotten chapel, and golden bells. Less than 10 minutes. No enemies. Just peace and hooves, and walking.",
